msgstr "非 3D"

msgctxt "V4L2_CID_PAN_ABSOLUTE"
msgid "Pan, Absolute"
msgstr "水平转动（绝对值）"

msgid "Picture"
msgstr "画面"

msgid "PipeWire's answer could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取 PipeWire 的响应。"

msgid "Plug in a camera. It appears here by itself, and you do not have to restart anything."
msgstr "请插入摄像头。它会自动出现在这里，无需重新启动任何东西。"

msgctxt "V4L2_CID_POWER_LINE_FREQUENCY"
msgid "Power Line Frequency"
msgstr "电源频率"

msgid "Programs built on Qt Multimedia, and programs that ask PipeWire for a camera, follow this default camera; they choose their own picture size and frame rate. A program in which you chose a camera keeps your choice."
msgstr "基于 Qt Multimedia 的程序以及向 PipeWire 请求摄像头的程序会遵循此默认摄像头；画面尺寸和每秒帧数由程序自行选择。在某个程序中选择过摄像头时，该程序保留您的选择。"

msgid "Programs that ask for a camera without choosing one get this camera."
msgstr "未指定摄像头就请求摄像头的程序会使用这个摄像头。"

msgid "Programs that choose their own size and format are not changed by this."
msgstr "自行选择尺寸和格式的程序不受此影响。"

msgid "Red/cyan"
msgstr "红/青"

msgid "Reset to the camera's defaults"
msgstr "恢复为摄像头默认值"

msgid "Rows, left eye first"
msgstr "行交错,左眼在前"

msgid "Rows, right eye first"
msgstr "行交错,右眼在前"

msgctxt "V4L2_CID_SATURATION"
msgid "Saturation"
msgstr "饱和度"

msgid "Settings for:"
msgstr "设置对象："

msgctxt "V4L2_CID_SHARPNESS"
msgid "Sharpness"
msgstr "锐度"

msgid "Show the pair in 3D"
msgstr "以 3D 显示这一对画面"

msgctxt "V4L2_EXPOSURE_SHUTTER_PRIORITY"
msgid "Shutter Priority Mode"
msgstr "快门优先模式"

msgid "Side by side quincunx, left eye first"
msgstr "左右并排梅花采样,左眼在前"

msgid "Side by side quincunx, right eye first"
msgstr "左右并排梅花采样,右眼在前"

msgid "Side by side, depth first"
msgstr "左右并排,深度在前"

msgid "Side by side, left eye first"
msgstr "左右并排,左眼在前"

msgid "Side by side, picture first"
msgstr "左右并排,图像在前"

msgid "Side by side, right eye first"
msgstr "左右并排,右眼在前"

msgid "Size:"
msgstr "尺寸："

msgid "Starting the preview…"
msgstr "正在启动预览…"

msgid "The camera changes this value by itself, so it is not kept."
msgstr "此值由摄像头自行改变，因此不会保存。"

msgid "The camera gives this control no range, so there is nothing to set or keep."
msgstr "摄像头没有为此调节项提供范围，因此没有可设置或保存的内容。"

msgid "The camera is not using this control now. Another setting turns it on."
msgstr "摄像头目前未使用此调节项，需要更改另一项设置才能启用。"

msgid "The camera only reports this value."
msgstr "摄像头仅报告此值。"

msgid "The preview could not start: %1"
msgstr "无法开始预览：%1"

msgid "The preview could not start: PipeWire did not accept the connection."
msgstr "无法开始预览：PipeWire 拒绝了连接。"

msgid "The preview could not start: PipeWire's loop was not created."
msgstr "无法开始预览：未能创建 PipeWire 循环。"

msgid "The preview stopped: %1"
msgstr "预览已停止：%1"

msgid "There is no default camera."
msgstr "没有默认摄像头。"

msgid "This computer's built-in camera has a known fault in how it sends pictures over USB. The system's kernel corrects it, so nothing needs to be done here."
msgstr "此电脑的内置摄像头在通过 USB 传输图像时存在已知故障。系统内核已对其进行修正，这里无需任何操作。"

msgid "This control moves the camera or starts an action, so it is not kept for the next time the camera is plugged in."
msgstr "此调节项会移动摄像头或启动某个动作，因此不会为下次插入摄像头而保存。"

msgid "This page cannot change this kind of control (%1)."
msgstr "此页面无法更改这种类型的调节项（%1）。"

msgid "This preview cannot show that packing. Other programs can."
msgstr "此预览无法显示这种排列方式，其他程序可以。"

